---
const apiUrl = (import.meta.env.PUBLIC_SOCIAL_API_URL ?? '').replace(/\/$/u, '');
---
<section class="tool-shell github-tool" data-social-contest data-provider="github" data-api-url={apiUrl} aria-labelledby="github-import-title">
  <div class="tool-panel-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">API REST officielle · Dépôts publics</p><h2 id="github-import-title">Une issue, ses commentaires, vos gagnants.</h2><p>Importez les commentaires généraux d’une issue ou pull request publique. Aucun compte GitHub n’est connecté.</p></div></div>
  <form class="social-import-form" data-contest-form>
    <div class="youtube-form-section youtube-form-section--source">
      <div class="youtube-section-heading"><span>01</span><div><strong>Conversation GitHub</strong><small>Issue ou pull request d’un dépôt public.</small></div></div>
      <label class="field"><span>URL GitHub</span><input name="url" type="url" inputmode="url" autocomplete="url" placeholder="https://github.com/organisation/depot/issues/…" required data-video-url /><small>Formats acceptés : /issues/123 et /pull/123.</small></label>
      <aside class="youtube-preview github-preview" data-preview data-state="idle" aria-live="polite"><div class="youtube-preview__empty"><span aria-hidden="true">GH</span><div><strong>Aperçu de la conversation</strong><small>Le titre, l’auteur et la date apparaîtront ici.</small></div></div><div class="github-post" data-publication hidden><p class="eyebrow">Conversation sélectionnée</p><p data-publication-title></p><small data-publication-meta></small></div></aside>
    </div>
    <div class="youtube-form-section">
      <div class="youtube-section-heading"><span>02</span><div><strong>Règles du tirage</strong><small>Les revues de code et réactions ne sont pas incluses.</small></div></div>
      <div class="form-row"><label class="field"><span>Gagnants</span><input name="winnerCount" type="number" min="1" max="100" value="1" required /></label><label class="field"><span>Suppléants</span><input name="alternateCount" type="number" min="0" max="100" value="0" required /></label></div>
      <label class="field"><span>Mot ou expression obligatoire <small>facultatif</small></span><input name="requiredKeyword" type="text" maxlength="120" placeholder="Ex. participation validée" /><small>Recherche sans distinction entre majuscules et minuscules.</small></label>
      <label class="field"><span>Comptes à exclure <small>facultatif</small></span><input name="excludedUsers" type="text" maxlength="2500" placeholder="octocat, autre-compte" /><small>Logins GitHub exacts, séparés par une virgule.</small></label>
      <div class="social-rule-grid github-rule-grid">
        <label class="option-card"><input name="duplicateEntries" type="checkbox" /><span><strong>Chaque commentaire compte</strong><small>Sinon, une seule chance par identifiant GitHub.</small></span></label>
        <label class="option-card"><input name="excludePublicationAuthor" type="checkbox" checked /><span><strong>Exclure l’auteur</strong><small>Le créateur de l’issue ou pull request ne participe pas.</small></span></label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="actions"><button class="button button-secondary" type="submit">Analyser la conversation</button><button class="button button-primary" type="button" data-import disabled>Importer les commentaires</button></div>
  </form>
  <div class="social-import-feedback" data-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite">Vérification du connecteur…</div>
  <div class="social-draw-panel" data-draw hidden><p data-progress></p><section class="social-rules-summary" aria-label="Règles appliquées"><h3>Votre liste, vos règles</h3><p>Règles figées pour cet import. Toute modification nécessite un nouvel import.</p><ul data-rules-summary></ul></section><label class="option-card"><input data-public-visibility type="checkbox" /><span><strong>Créer un lien de résultat public</strong><small>La conversation, les gagnants, les règles et les empreintes sont partagés, pas la liste complète.</small></span></label><button class="button button-primary" type="button" data-draw-button disabled>Lancer le tirage</button><div class="result-card" data-result hidden></div></div>
</section>
<script>import '../scripts/social-contest';</script>
<style>
  .github-tool { --color-primary:#59636e; }
  .github-tool .youtube-form-section { border-color:color-mix(in srgb,#8b949e 32%,var(--color-border)); }
  .github-tool .youtube-form-section--source, .github-preview { background:linear-gradient(120deg,color-mix(in srgb,#8b949e 9%,var(--color-surface)),var(--color-surface)); }
  .github-tool .youtube-section-heading > span { color:#f0f6fc; background:#30363d; }
  .github-preview { margin-top:1rem; border-color:color-mix(in srgb,#8b949e 38%,var(--color-border)); color:var(--color-text); }
  .github-preview::after { background:none; }
  .github-preview .youtube-preview__empty small, .github-post small { color:var(--color-text-muted); }
  .github-post { padding:1.25rem; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
  .github-post > p[data-publication-title] { font-size:1.08rem; line-height:1.55; }
  .github-rule-grid { margin-top:1rem; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  @media (max-width:650px) { .github-rule-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
</style>
